      "content": "It sounds like you are in an immense amount of pain right now, and the silence must feel deafeningly loud. Please know that what you are feeling—this emptiness and disorientation—is a profound response to such a massive life change. Be gentle with yourself during this time; there is no expectation for you to \"do\" anything other than breathe and allow yourself to grieve. If you feel overwhelmed, please consider reaching out to a grief counselor or a support hotline.",
